Template: nimbuscore/role
Type: select
Choices: unset, master, worker
Default: unset
Description: Role of this machine in the NimbusCore cluster:
 Choose "master" to run nimbus-apiserver (control plane) or "worker" to
 run nimbus-agent (executes pods, requires Docker). Only the service
 matching this role will be enabled, to avoid accidentally running an
 agent on a control-plane node or vice versa. Leave "unset" (the default
 for unattended/non-interactive installs) to enable neither service and
 decide later with 'dpkg-reconfigure nimbuscore'.
